{"sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","items":[{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k001","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"이온 평형전위는 농도기울기와 전기적 힘이 균형을 이룰 때의 막전위다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k002","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"Nernst 식 E=(RT/zF)ln([ion]out/[ion]in)을 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k003","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"37℃에서 약 61.5 mV/z×log₁₀(out/in)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k004","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"실제 막전위는 여러 이온의 상대 투과도에 영향을 받으며 Goldman 식으로 근사할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k005","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"휴지막전위는 흔히 K⁺ 누출통로에 크게 좌우되고 Na⁺/K⁺ ATPase는 농도 기울기를 유지한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k006","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"활동전위의 상승기는 전압개폐 Na⁺ 통로의 활성화, 재분극은 Na⁺ 통로 불활성화와 K⁺ 통로 활성화에 의해 설명된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k007","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"절대 불응기는 주로 Na⁺ 통로 불활성화, 상대 불응기는 높은 K⁺ 전도도와 일부 Na⁺ 통로 회복 상태에 관련된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k008","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"수초는 막 저항을 높이고 정전용량을 낮춰 도약전도를 가능하게 한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k009","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"전도 속도는 축삭 직경과 수초에 영향을 받는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k010","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"활동전위의 크기보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k011","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"빈도가 자극 세기 정보를 담는 경우가 많다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k012","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"Nernst 식은 단일 이온의 평형전위다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k013","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"이온 이동 방향은 Vm−Eion 및 전하에 따라 달라진다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k014","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"절대 불응기에는 일반적으로 새 활동전위 유도가 불가능하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k015","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"말초 수초: Schwann 세포, 중추 수초: oligodendrocyte.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--membrane-potential-k016","sectionId":"neuro/membrane-potential","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"일반적으로 덜 음전하인 방향으로 변한다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}